{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lost : Taboo Forest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am just an ordinary person, no different from anyone else. But I won\u2019t let the people I care about disappear just like that. The elders in our village have never allowed anyone to go into that forest, because those who do never come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I can\u2019t see what others can with a sixth sense. I used to believe that the unseen never existed here\u2014but I think I was wrong. I\u2019ve heard things that shouldn\u2019t be there. They exist, even if I\u2019ve never seen them. I didn\u2019t believe it, but now I have to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as someone who is forced to enter the forbidden forest in search of his missing sister. Within the forest, many dangerous creatures lurk, but you can\u2019t see them. All you have is a flashlight to help you explore. The flashlight\u2019s battery can run out, so you must search for batteries to keep seeing in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With limited vision and the darkness of night, the atmosphere in this game becomes even more intense. You have to run when you hear something that isn\u2019t coming from you\u2014but you can\u2019t run forever, as your stamina is limited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657460/extras/55c31d85550f5fd00190b043c7134d29.avif?t=1748070859\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657460/extras_big/55c31d85550f5fd00190b043c7134d29.avif?t=1748070859 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are objectives in the form of breakers for you to turn on, and most of them require a key. These keys are scattered in various places on the map. You need to find the key from the clue given by the ghost of a creature that only you can hear</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657460/extras/3f81c2d6c0befdd020eebb81a0d33359.avif?t=1748070859\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657460/extras_big/3f81c2d6c0befdd020eebb81a0d33359.avif?t=1748070859 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3657460?t=1748070859","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3657460?t=1748070859","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657460/1c1729ed6ddaefe49a968741fa44a204399ea472/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748070859","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657460/1c1729ed6ddaefe49a968741fa44a204399ea472/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748070859","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lost : Taboo Forest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am just an ordinary person, no different from anyone else. But I won\u2019t let the people I care about disappear just like that. The elders in our village have never allowed anyone to go into that forest, because those who do never come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I can\u2019t see what others can with a sixth sense. I used to believe that the unseen never existed here\u2014but I think I was wrong. I\u2019ve heard things that shouldn\u2019t be there. They exist, even if I\u2019ve never seen them. I didn\u2019t believe it, but now I have to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as someone who is forced to enter the forbidden forest in search of his missing sister. Within the forest, many dangerous creatures lurk, but you can\u2019t see them. All you have is a flashlight to help you explore. The flashlight\u2019s battery can run out, so you must search for batteries to keep seeing in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With limited vision and the darkness of night, the atmosphere in this game becomes even more intense. You have to run when you hear something that isn\u2019t coming from you\u2014but you can\u2019t run forever, as your stamina is limited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657460/extras/55c31d85550f5fd00190b043c7134d29.avif?t=1748070859\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657460/extras_big/55c31d85550f5fd00190b043c7134d29.avif?t=1748070859 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are objectives in the form of breakers for you to turn on, and most of them require a key. These keys are scattered in various places on the map. You need to find the key from the clue given by the ghost of a creature that only you can hear</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657460/extras/3f81c2d6c0befdd020eebb81a0d33359.avif?t=1748070859\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657460/extras_big/3f81c2d6c0befdd020eebb81a0d33359.avif?t=1748070859 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","developers":["Gambut Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657460/9bd9f8561f47e5a24fa102c24f05694b745e7b5b/header.jpg?t=1748070859","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies